  "body": "I think the commit that added the streams API only consolidated what was needed to define the shared getters, but it seems to me that they both have a decoder and stream that are of the same type so those could be put on TextDecoderCommon as well.\r\n\r\nNot doing this as part of #175 as that's getting rather big already and would be nice if @ricea could confirm.",
